th their classmates.','PUNCTUALITY SHOWS STUDENTS RESPECT TIME AND IMPORTANT SCHEDULES.','Values time','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(234,52,15,'Which quality helps students achieve goals through effort?','','','Fear discourages students from attempting challenging academic tasks.','Anger distracts students from achieving their important academic goals.','Laziness prevents students from completing important academic responsibilities.','Hard work helps students achieve goals through effort.','HARD WORK HELPS STUDENTS ACHIEVE GOALS THROUGH EFFORT.','Consistent effort','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(235,52,15,'What quality makes students eager to learn?','','','Carelessness makes students ignore important details during lessons.','Pride prevents students from accepting helpful advice willingly.','Dishonesty damages trust between students and their teachers.','Curiosity makes students eager to discover new knowledge.','CURIOSITY MAKES STUDENTS EAGER TO DISCOVER NEW KNOWLEDGE.','Loves learning','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(236,52,15,'Which quality helps students remain focused during studies?','','','Confusion makes students struggle to understand difficult lessons.','Concentration helps students remain focused during their studies.','Laziness prevents students from maintaining regular study habits.','Fear reduces confidence during challenging academic situations significantly.','CONCENTRATION HELPS STUDENTS REMAIN FOCUSED DURING THEIR STUDIES.','Stay focused','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(237,52,15,'Which quality means accepting responsibility for academic duties?','','','Anger creates conflicts and affects classroom relationships negatively.','Jealousy makes students compare themselves with classmates unnecessarily.','Responsibility means completing academic duties without constant reminders.','Carelessness causes students to neglect important academic responsibilities.','RESPONSIBILITY MEANS COMPLETING ACADEMIC DUTIES WITHOUT CONSTANT REMINDERS.','Own your duties','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(238,52,15,'Which quality means treating teachers and classmates well?','','','Pride makes students unwilling to accept corrections gracefully.','Fear prevents students from communicating their problems openly.','Laziness reduces participation in important classroom activities.','Respect means treating teachers and classmates with dignity.','RESPECT MEANS TREATING TEACHERS AND CLASSMATES WITH DIGNITY.','Value others','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(239,52,15,'Which quality means avoiding cheating during examinations?','','','Anger can negatively affect decisions during stressful situations.','Curiosity encourages students to investigate interesting academic subjects.','Competition motivates students to improve their academic performance.','Honesty means avoiding cheating and speaking the truth.','HONESTY MEANS AVOIDING CHEATING AND SPEAKING THE TRUTH.','Speak truth','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(240,52,15,'Which skill helps students organize their study time?','','','Laziness wastes valuable time and delays important responsibilities.','Time management helps students organize their study schedules.','Fear makes students avoid difficult academic tasks.','Anger wastes time through unnecessary classroom arguments.','TIME MANAGEMENT HELPS STUDENTS ORGANIZE THEIR STUDY SCHEDULES.','Use time wisely','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(241,52,15,'What quality helps students believe in their abilities?','','','Carelessness causes students to overlook important academic details.','Jealousy makes students focus negatively on other classmates.','Anger prevents students from thinking calmly and clearly.','Self-confidence helps students believe strongly in themselves.','SELF-CONFIDENCE HELPS STUDENTS BELIEVE STRONGLY IN THEMSELVES.','Believe yourself','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(242,52,15,'Which attitude helps students learn from their mistakes?','','','Positive attitude helps students learn from mistakes.','Laziness prevents students from learning through regular practice.','Fear discourages students from attempting challenging academic tasks.','Dishonesty prevents students from accepting their mistakes.','POSITIVE ATTITUDE HELPS STUDENTS LEARN FROM MISTAKES.','Think positively','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(243,52,15,'Which quality helps students understand instructions clearly?','','','Anger makes students unable to listen calmly.','Pride prevents students from accepting useful instructions.','Good listening helps students understand instructions clearly.','Carelessness causes students to miss important classroom instructions.','GOOD LISTENING HELPS STUDENTS UNDERSTAND INSTRUCTIONS CLEARLY.','Pay attention','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(244,52,15,'Which quality means continuing despite difficulties and failures?','','','Laziness makes students stop when tasks become difficult.','Perseverance means continuing despite difficulties and repeated failures.','Fear discourages students from facing challenging academic situations.','Anger reduces patience during difficult academic problems.','PERSEVERANCE MEANS CONTINUING DESPITE DIFFICULTIES AND REPEATED FAILURES.','Never give up','medium','','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806','2026-09-08 06:42:01.806'),(245,52,15,'Which quality helps students cooperate with others?','','','Competition focuses mainly on defeating other participants.','Isolation prevents students from learning through group activities.','Anger creates conflicts during important group activities.','Teamwork helps students cooperate and achieve shared goals.','TEAMWORK HELPS STUDENTS COOPERATE AND ACHIEVE SHARED GOALS.','Work toget